# Architecture — Living Spatial Mindspace

## Scene Structure
Two scenes managed by Unity's SceneManager:
- **MainMenu** (index 0): UI-only scene, loads on startup
- **SampleScene** (index 1): the 3D world

## Core Scripts

### Player system
- `FirstPersonController.cs` — WASD movement, mouse-look via 
  CharacterController. Freezes when edit panel is open. 
  Escape returns to main menu with cursor unlock.

### Knowledge card system
- `KnowledgeCard.cs` — owns a card's type, content, and visual 
  state. Exposes GetContent/SetContent for save and AI systems.
- `CardInteractor.cs` — fires a ViewportPointToRay raycast each 
  frame, detects which card the player looks at, handles E (edit), 
  G (grab/move), Delete. Deactivates before destroying to prevent 
  save-race condition.
- `CardSpawner.cs` — spawns typed card prefabs on N/T/I keypresses, 
  blocked while edit panel is open.
- `CardEditUI.cs` — Canvas overlay with OnGUI() text capture. 
  Bypasses Unity's EventSystem entirely for reliable input.

### Persistence
- `WorldSaveManager.cs` — singleton. Serializes all KnowledgeCard 
  positions, rotations, types and content to JSON via 
  JsonUtility. Saves on every card change. Loads on Start().
  Path: Application.persistentDataPath/worldsave.json

### AI Curator system
- `AICurator.cs` — singleton. Runs ScanAllCards() on a 30-second 
  InvokeRepeating loop and after every save. For each card pair, 
  computes word-overlap similarity (Jaccard-style containment) 
  after stop-word removal and tokenisation. Pairs above 0.2 
  threshold form a CardConnection.
- `CuratorOrb.cs` — waypoint-based wandering near room perimeter 
  at ceiling height. Actively avoids player position. Flashes 
  emission on new connection discovery.
- `ConnectionRenderer.cs` — reads AICurator.connections list and 
  instantiates LineRenderer objects between related card pairs. 
  Line width and alpha encode connection strength. Pulses opacity 
  each frame for living quality.
- `CuratorLightController.cs` — point light that idles with gentle 
  sine pulse and spikes intensity when curator finds new connections.

### Main menu
- `MainMenuController.cs` — checks for save file existence to show 
  Enter vs Continue. Wires button listeners. Unlocks cursor on load.

